  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RBM-st&#xf6;d till p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende insatser inom CSO-strategin 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBM-support to ongoing contributions under the CSO-strategy 2026 - RBM-support to review SMC results framework and ToC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment involves assisting the unit in reviewing the theory of change and results frameworks that the SMR consortium has presented in its application to the CSO strategy, and subsequently been asked to update. The consultant will review these documents and recommend improvements in order to strengthen their usefulness as strategic management tools for the initiative. The consultants who carry out the assignment have several years of experience in similar reviews.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget inneb&#xe4;r att bist&#xe5; enheten i granskningar av f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsteori och resultatramverk som SMR-konsortiet har presenterat i sin ans&#xf6;kning till CSO-strategin, och d&#xe4;refter ombetts uppdatera. Konsulten kommer granska dessa dokument samt rekommendera f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar i syfte att st&#xe4;rka deras anv&#xe4;ndbarhet som strategiska styrverktyg f&#xf6;r insatsen. De konsulter som genomf&#xf6;r uppdraget har m&#xe5;ng&#xe5;rig erfarenhet av liknande granskningar.</narrative>
  </description>
